                <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">Yomari Purnhe Celebration of 2025</h2>
                <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
                    Join the Newah community for one of our most heartwarming celebrations — Yomari Punhi,
                    a festival that honors abundance, community, and the end of the rice harvest.
                    This full-moon day marks not just the making of yomari (a delicious steamed dumpling
                    made of rice flour and filled with molasses and sesame seeds), but also a gathering of family,
                    friends, and generations. Come experience traditional Newar rituals, music, dance, food,
                    and heartfelt togetherness as we light candles and share blessings.
                </p>
